---
// src/components/landing/HowItWorks.astro
---

<section class="py-16 bg-neutral-50/50 border-t border-neutral-200 no-print">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
    <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto space-y-2">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 font-medium">Simple 3-Step Workflow</span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-950">
        How to generate quotations in minutes
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 shadow-2xs space-y-3">
        <span class="text-2xl font-mono font-bold text-neutral-400">01</span>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-950">Fill in Details & Logo</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
          Enter your company info, client details, upload your brand logo, and customize the quote title, number, and issue date.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 shadow-2xs space-y-3">
        <span class="text-2xl font-mono font-bold text-neutral-400">02</span>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-950">Add Items, Discounts & Taxes</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
          List your products or services, set quantities, units, and rates. Apply percentage or fixed discounts, multi-tax rows, and deposits.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 shadow-2xs space-y-3">
        <span class="text-2xl font-mono font-bold text-neutral-400">03</span>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-950">Preview & Download PDF</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
          Pick your favorite designer template, inspect the real-time A4 preview, and click Download PDF or Print for instant vector export.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
